CompetitorAdAssessment.description:
One append-only revision of an observation's relevance. ``created_by``
is the member who flipped it (null for the scan's own judgments);
``previous`` is what a flip replaced.

DirectionView.description:
A direction card. ``direction_id`` is the stable plan-local id used
by ``revise``; ``factors`` is the folded "factors and values" section;
``selected_in`` counts this direction's combinations per scale.

ProductSummary.description:
One product as the front flow lists it (Issue #162). ``name`` is the
effective ProductVersion's name (``null`` only when nothing names it);
``ready`` is whether a new Generation draft may use it;
``primary_reference_version_id`` previews through
``create_library_reference_download_intent``.

TagConfirmation.description:
The latest confirmed tags. ``experiment_ready`` says the image has
concept identity (it can be frozen into an experiment);
``attributable`` says learnings can place it in a test round.
